7 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489467 1071 "What is the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=24 x - 60 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$ at the point $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$?" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489467 1072 #uuid "308d927b-9585-594c-b5e7-da139c2cdf56" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489467 1074 "The slope is the derivative evaluated at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}.$\n\nWe know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sin x)=\\cos x,$ and that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\cos x)=-\\sin x.$ Applying these formulas and the sum and constant multiple rules, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} &= \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(24 x - 60 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &= (60 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(24) \\\\ &= 60 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6},$ we get\n\n$$\ny^{\\prime}(\\frac{\\pi}{6})=24+60\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{6})=24+60\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=54.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope is $54.$" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489468 1080 "44" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489468 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489468 1083 #uuid "39359cea-c70f-5460-a00b-b3252b77490d" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489469 1080 "18" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489469 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489469 1083 #uuid "3ba991d8-77cd-5adf-a4be-6a604604dc7b" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489470 1068 #edb/ref 17592186489494 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489470 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489470 1071 "What is the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=22 x - 55 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}$ at the point $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$?" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489470 1072 #uuid "44191e59-3ef1-56f2-b3ae-15156e95a80d" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489470 1074 "The slope is the derivative evaluated at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}.$\n\nWe know that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sin x)=\\cos x,$ and that $\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\cos x)=-\\sin x.$ Applying these formulas and the sum and constant multiple rules, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} &= \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(22 x - 55 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)}) \\\\ &= (55 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)})+(22) \\\\ &= 55 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 22.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{6},$ we get\n\n$$\ny^{\\prime}(\\frac{\\pi}{6})=22+55\\sin(\\frac{\\pi}{6})=22+55\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{99}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope is $\\frac{99}{2}.$" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489471 1080 "\\frac{99}{4}" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489471 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489471 1083 #uuid "4dc0f155-25cd-54c2-a5ca-25242fdd9010" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489472 1080 "\\frac{121}{2}" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489472 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489472 1083 #uuid "61d971aa-f63d-5d90-8b35-1be41f05b791" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489473 1080 "-42" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489473 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489473 1083 #uuid "6612c30b-4a4f-5379-9362-7887231b0c78" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489474 1080 "36" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489474 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489474 1083 #uuid "6631f744-56ce-5b33-810f-f48c092b445f" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489475 1080 "- 16 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)} - \\frac{16}{x^{2}}" 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489475 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535276 17592186045443 true] [17592186489475 1083 #uuid "66e44a42-